  &lt;p class=""&gt;Welcome to 30 Traymore Crescent a breathtaking luxury home steps from Old Mill and Humber River. No detail was overlooked in this back-to-the-bricks custom renovation completed in 2019. This spacious, light filled home, was thoughtfully designed including numerous smart home features. It is a true labour of love and must be seen to be appreciated.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;The stunning open concept main floor features, white oak chevron floors, a marble gas fireplace, and a sun filled chefs kitchen! With a Wolf range, Sub-Zero fridge, marble countertops and oversized south facing windows it's perfect for entertaining or enjoying dinner with the family. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;The second floor includes three spacious bedrooms, two full baths, and a bright office or flex space overlooking the backyard plus a convenient second laundry room! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;The 3rd floor principle retreat includes an oversized dressing room with custom built-in cabinetry, skylights, and a stunning 5 piece ensuite. A true spa like bath with a walk-in shower, private WC, and a jetted soaker tub. The basement has 8 foot ceilings, a flexible rec room, laundry room, walk-up to backyard, and a media room. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Additional upgrades include large Pella windows throughout, in-floor radiant heating, high-velocity Space Pak air-conditioning, built-in speakers on main floor, and pre-wired for 100 amp EV charger. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;This home is perfectly situated with a 7 minute walk to Bloor West Village, Jane &amp;amp; Old Mill TTC Stations, and short drive to the Gardiner. Only a 20 minute drive to both Pearson Airport and Downtown! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Move-in and enjoy this family friendly neighbourhood with a community feel. This home is truly one of a kind!&lt;/p&gt;





















  
  








   
