  &lt;p class=""&gt;Welcome to 51 Lower Simcoe Street #201–a highly functional &amp;amp; spacious 1 bedroom plus den unit with parking &amp;amp; locker in the heart of Downtown. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;The open concept floorpan utilizes every inch of space to maximize usability and provide abundant storage space. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Boasting 9 foot ceilings, updated engineered hardwood floors (2021), two walk-outs to an oversized balcony, floor-to-ceiling windows, updated washer &amp;amp; dryer (2022), and custom roller blinds with blackouts in the bedroom. This unit has it all! Including not one, but two walk-in closets with custom built-in shelving. This unit has been meticulously maintained and cared for by the same owners for almost 10 years and reflects true pride of ownership. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Enjoy everything Toronto has to offer with the CN Tower, Roger’s Centre, Scotiabank Arena, Harborfront Centre, and waterfront nearby. Get around with ease with Union Station, UP Express, GO trains and subway all in walking distance.&lt;/p&gt;





















  
  








   
