  &lt;p class=""&gt;Welcome to 80 John Street unit #2604 at the iconic Festival Tower–one of Toronto's most sought after buildings. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;This 1-bedroom plus den unit includes parking, locker, and just over 600 square feet of highly functional living space. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Featuring a bright open concept living room with downtown views &amp;amp; beautiful afternoon sun, a high-end kitchen with Miele appliances &amp;amp; a built-in centre island, hardwood flooring, and floor-to-ceiling windows. The den is separated from the primary living area for added privacy and makes the perfect home office or guest bedroom with convenient access to the 4-piece ensuite bathroom. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;World class amenities include an extensive gym with squat racks &amp;amp; free weights, and a 66 person theatre-free to use by Festival Tower residents. The expansive outdoor terrace has cabanas, BBQs, &amp;amp; fire pits. Enjoy spa treatment rooms, a yoga studio, business centre, sports bar, and an indoor pool with hot tub, and sauna.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Walk to the streetcar in 1-minute, St Andrew station in 6-minutes, and the Go Train/Up Express at Union station in 15-minutes. Situated in the heart of the Entertainment District and steps from theatres, bistros, and King West nightlife.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Enjoy everything downtown Toronto has to offer from this perfectly situated unit.&lt;/p&gt;





















  
  








   
