  &lt;p class=""&gt;Welcome to 9T6 Condos–a rarely available and highly sought after boutique building in the heart of Downtown Toronto. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;This 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom unit is the perfect home for a first time buyer, young professional, or university student. You'll have plenty of space in the bright, open concept living &amp;amp; dining areas with hardwood floors and floor-to-ceiling windows. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;The highly functional kitchen comes with stainless steel appliances, granite countertops, and a breakfast bar. The spacious primary bedroom features a generous walk-in closet and enough space for a king size bed and side tables. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Enjoy various amenities including the gym, guest suite, library, outdoor hot tub, patio with BBQs, 24 hour concierge, visitor parking, and bike storage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;You'll be conveniently situated on quiet St. Patrick Street and close to Universities, Hospitals, Restaurants, nightlife, and much more. Walking distance to Chinatown, Kensington Market, and beautiful Grange Park.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Only a 4 minute walk to St Patrick Station and steps away from Queen and Dundas West streetcars. Have peace of mind living in this meticulously managed building with responsive management and concierge staff.&lt;/p&gt;





















  
  








   
