  &lt;p class=""&gt;Welcome to 50 Halford Avenue–a stunning detached home in Old Mill! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Situated on an oversized 50 by 180 foot ravine lot. Featuring a one of a kind backyard overlooking the Humber river and Etienne Brulé park and surrounded by beautiful mature trees. A serene escape from city life!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Completely renovated in 2017 including hardwood floors throughout, two new bathrooms, two brand new custom kitchens with new appliances, cabinets, and granite counters. Second level includes a large deck just outside the dining room–perfect for BBQ'ing with family and friends. Walk-out from the main level living room to a deck and a shaded flagstone patio. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;This home is situated in one of the most sought after locations in the West End and the entire city! Steps to Humber River, Lessard Park, and only an 8 minute walk to Jane station and Bloor West Village.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Enjoy cottage-like tranquility with access to everything the city has to offer. &lt;/p&gt;





















  
  








   
