  &lt;p class=""&gt;Welcome to 421 Bloor Street East Unit #404. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;This is a perfect entry level unit for a medical practice or professional office. The multifunctional space can serve various uses such as doctor, dentist, physiotherapist, psychotherapist, chiropractor, lawyer, accountant, public relations, architect, and others. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Current floorplan includes a small waiting room and a partial wall separating the kitchenette–you can leave the layout as is or modify it to suit your needs. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Very bright &amp;amp; airy space with 9 foot ceilings and a large window overlooking Rosedale Valley.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Conveniently situated downtown and right across the street from Sherbourne TTC station. Maintenance fees include all utilities.&lt;/p&gt;





















  
  








   
