  &lt;p class=""&gt;Calling all outdoor enthusiasts! Lush parks, walking trails and bike paths await at this sunny, corner unit at Humber Bay Shores. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Featuring 9.5 foot ceilings, near floor-to ceiling windows, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, and a separate den that'll make the perfect home office. The split bedroom floorplan is highly functional with no wasted space. Gorgeous views of summer greenery and the lake. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;State-of-the-art W Club gym and yoga studio with free classes. Other amenities include a pool, steam room, sauna, hot tub, squash courts and rooftop terrace with BBQ’s. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;Metro, LCBO, Shoppers, banks and other shops on ground level. Walk to the Lakeshore in under 10 minutes. And don’t forget the Humber Bay Shores farmers market every Saturday! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=""&gt;5 minute drive or shuttle bus to Mimico GO Station. Quick access to Gardiner, 5 minutes to highway 427, and 18 minutes to Pearson Airport.&lt;/p&gt;


























